| Type             | Socket-programming use                     |
| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------ |
| `int`            | Socket and file descriptors                |
| `char`           | Individual characters and byte buffers     |
| `unsigned short` | Port numbers                               |
| `size_t`         | Buffer sizes                               |
| `ssize_t`        | Number of bytes read, or `-1` for an error |
